    <briefdescription>
<para>Integrity-event reporting: fault handler, statistics, self-test. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The observability interface a health monitor hooks into. Every integrity event (recovery, unrecoverable corruption, lock timeout, overwritten contents, clamped mutator return) is reported exactly once per detection. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
